title: WaystationArrival
---
<<declare $waystation_tutorial_done = false>>

=== waystation_arrival ===
The Waystation hums. Purified tech—clean, precise, sterile. Chrome walls pulse with coolant lines. The air smells of ozone and antiseptic.

KAEL-7: "Welcome to Outpost 9. Purified stronghold. Home."

A Purified officer approaches—chrome faceplate, rank insignia glowing.

PURIFIED COMMANDER: "Walker. Designation?"

*   "Signal Walker. No number." -> waystation_firstgen
*   "I don't remember." -> waystation_amnesia
*   "Classified." -> waystation_classified

=== waystation_firstgen ===
PURIFIED COMMANDER: "No number. First Generation? Original Walkers were numbered. You predate the protocols."

He transmits something. "Medical Bay. Diagnostics. *Then* briefing."

KAEL-7: "Come. I'll show you the systems."

-> waystation_systems_intro

=== waystation_amnesia ===
PURIFIED COMMANDER: "Memory corruption. Cryo-sickness. Expected. Medical Bay. Diagnostics. *Then* briefing."

KAEL-7: "Come. I'll show you the systems."

-> waystation_systems_intro

=== waystation_classified ===
PURIFIED COMMANDER: *dryly* "Classified. Purified records are sealed too. We'll get along fine."

KAEL-7: "Come. I'll show you the systems."

-> waystation_systems_intro

=== waystation_systems_intro ===
Kael leads you through the chrome corridors. Holographic displays. Fabricators humming. Med-bays glowing.

KAEL-7: "Five systems. Learn them. Live by them."

*   [Fabricator] Crafting, mods, gear -> waystation_fabricator
*   [Medical Bay] Healing, corruption, implants -> waystation_medbay
*   [Intel Terminal] Factions, zones, quests -> waystation_intel
*   [Signal Beacon] Respec, spend points -> waystation_beacon
*   [Companion Bench] Party, synergy, combos -> waystation_companion
*   "Enough. Let me explore." -> waystation_free_explore

=== waystation_fabricator ===
A massive 3D printer. Chrome powder. Energy beams.

KAEL-7: "**Fabricator.** Scrap + Tech Components = Gear. Weapons. Armor. Chips. Mods."

*   "Show me crafting." -> waystation_crafting_demo
*   "Show me mods." -> waystation_mods_demo
*   "Next." -> waystation_medbay

=== waystation_crafting_demo ===
KAEL-7: "Select blueprint. Insert materials. Wait. *Done*."

*Demo: Craft **Chrome Plating** (Armor Mod) — 50 Scrap, 5 Tech Components*

*Crafted: Chrome Plating — +3 Armor, -1 Move Range*

-> waystation_fabricator

=== waystation_mods_demo ===
KAEL-7: "Chips. Slots in gear. Damage. Defense. Utility. Resonance."

*Demo: Install **Targeting Chip** (Weapon) — +1 Range, +10% Crit*

*Installed: Targeting Chip on Pulse Pistol*

-> waystation_fabricator

=== waystation_medbay ===
Sterile white. Auto-docs. Tanks of blue fluid.

KAEL-7: "**Medical Bay.** Heal. Cure corruption. Install implants. *Purify*."

*   "Show me corruption cure." -> waystation_corruption_cure
*   "Show me implants." -> waystation_implants
*   "Next." -> waystation_intel

=== waystation_corruption_cure ===
KAEL-7: "The Rust rewrites biology. Tech. *You*."

*Demo: **Purification Serum** — Cleanse 50 Corruption, 30-min immunity*

*Acquired: Purification Serum x2*

-> waystation_medbay

=== waystation_implants ===
KAEL-7: "Chrome replaces flesh. Stronger. Faster. *Purified*."

*Demo: **Targeting Array** (Eye) — +15% Accuracy, +1 Range*

*Implant installed: Targeting Array (Right Eye)*

-> waystation_medbay

=== waystation_intel ===
Holo-table. Sector map. Faction territories pulsing.

KAEL-7: "**Intel Terminal.** Faction rep. Zone data. Quests. Bounties."

*   "Show faction rep." -> waystation_faction_rep
*   "Show zone data." -> waystation_zone_data
*   "Show quests." -> waystation_quests
*   "Next." -> waystation_beacon

=== waystation_faction_rep ===
KAEL-7: "Purified: **Allied** (You). Rooted: **Hostile** (Mara). Scavengers: **Neutral**."

*   "How to improve Rooted?" -> waystation_improve_rooted
*   "How to improve Scavengers?" -> waystation_improve_scavengers
*   "Next." -> waystation_intel

=== waystation_improve_rooted ===
KAEL-7: "Help the Green. Cleanse corruption *their* way. Don't purge. *Harmonize*."

-> waystation_faction_rep

=== waystation_improve_scavengers ===
KAEL-7: "Trade. Jobs. Information. They respect *cred*, not creed."

-> waystation_faction_rep

=== waystation_zone_data ===
KAEL-7: "Sector 9: Graveyard (Here). Purified Citadel (North). Rooted Grove (East). Freeport (South). Sector 8: Wastes (East). Purified Stronghold (North). Rooted Heartland (East)."

-> waystation_intel

=== waystation_quests ===
KAEL-7: "Available: **Chrome Ghost** (Kael-6, Deep Foundry). **Signal Echo** (West Corridor). **Rust Purge** (Maintenance Tunnels)."

-> waystation_intel

=== waystation_beacon ===
A pillar of light. Signal energy contained.

KAEL-7: "**Signal Beacon.** Respec nodes. Spend Signal Points. Unlock mutations. *Reconnect* to Oracle."

*   "Respec demo." -> waystation_respec_demo
*   "Signal nodes." -> waystation_signal_nodes
*   "Next." -> waystation_companion

=== waystation_respec_demo ===
KAEL-7: "One Resonance Core + 1000 Scrap. Full reset. Or partial."

*Demo: Refund **RES_AMP** (1 SP returned)*

*SP refunded: 1*

-> waystation_beacon

=== waystation_signal_nodes ===
KAEL-7: "Five branches. Resonance. Biology. Tech. Stealth. Leadership. Capstones at Tier 3."

-> waystation_beacon

=== waystation_companion ===
A bench with linked stations. Holographic companions.

KAEL-7: "**Companion Bench.** Manage party. View synergy. Unlock combos. *Bond*."

*   "View Kael's synergy." -> waystation_kael_synergy
*   "View Mara's synergy." -> waystation_mara_synergy
*   "Next." -> waystation_free_explore

=== waystation_kael_synergy ===
KAEL-7: *to himself* "Synergy Rank 1. Trust. +10% Accuracy when adjacent."

*Synergy Tree: Trust -> Resonance -> Harmony -> Synchronization -> **Iron Symphony*** (Dual Ultimate)

-> waystation_companion

=== waystation_mara_synergy ===
KAEL-7: "The Green one. Rank 1. *Noted*."

*Synergy Tree: Trust -> Resonance -> Harmony -> Synchronization -> **Primal Chorus*** (Dual Ultimate)

-> waystation_companion

=== waystation_free_explore ===
KAEL-7: "Rest. Rearm. The Graveyard doesn't wait."

*Waystation unlocked. Free exploration enabled.*

-> act1_begin

=== act1_begin ===
**PROLOGUE COMPLETE**
*Signal Walker Awakened*
*First Companion Recruited*
*Faction Contact Established*
